Ae shahe do jahaa'n khudahafiz<br />
ae mohammed ki jaa'n khudahafiz<br />
<br />
Ham shabeehe nabi hussain ke laal<br />
akbare noujawaa'nkhudahafiz<br />
<br />
Ae shahedee'n ke tashnalab yaawar<br />
asghare be zabaa'n khudahafiz<br />
<br />
pherne waale khushk hoto'n par<br />
apni sookhi zabaa'n khudahafiz<br />
<br />
paaemaale gham o alam qasim<br />
jaao shabbar ki jaa'n khudahafiz<br />
<br />
ae alamdaare fouj ae abbas<br />
ae ali ke nashaa'n khudahafiz<br />
<br />
ho chuki aaj qatm mehmaani<br />
shiyo'n ke mehmaa'n khudahafiz